---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Playground from '../components/Playground.astro';
import ProjectArtwork from '../components/ProjectArtwork.astro';
import { projects } from '../data/projects';
---
<Layout>
  <Header home />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow mono"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> KENT · DESIGNER & CREATIVE TECHNOLOGIST</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Serious<br />about <span class="play-word">play<svg viewBox="0 0 240 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12Q114-3 234 8M19 19q107-12 199-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span><span class="cobalt">.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">I’m Kent. I bring <strong>design, code, and physical spaces</strong> together to make things people can play with, take part in, and remember.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="#work">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#about">Meet the maker <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <div class="hero-footnote mono"><span class="tiny-plus">✳</span> A DESIGNER’S EYE. A MAKER’S CURIOSITY.</div>
      </div>
      <Playground />
    </section>
    <div class="discipline-strip" aria-label="Working across interaction design, creative technology, and spatial experiences"><div class="wrap strip-inner"><span>Thoughtful by design.</span><svg viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 0v30M0 15h30M4 4l22 22M4 26 26 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" /></svg><span>Playful by nature.</span><svg viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 0v30M0 15h30M4 4l22 22M4 26 26 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" /></svg><span>Made to be experienced.</span><span class="strip-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↙</span></div></div>
    <section class="work-section wrap" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow mono">01 / THE WORK</p><h2 id="work-title">Ideas, out in the world<span class="cobalt">.</span></h2></div><p>A few things I’ve helped bring to life.<br />Different mediums. The same curiosity.</p></div>
      <div class="project-grid">
        {projects.map((project) => (
          <article class={`project-card project-${project.kind}`}>
            <ProjectArtwork kind={project.kind} />
            <div class="project-meta mono"><span>{project.category}</span><span>{project.year}</span></div>
            <h3><a href={`/work/${project.slug}/`} class="project-link">{project.title}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
            <p class="project-line">{project.line}</p>
            <p class="project-role"><span>MY PART</span> {project.role}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="work-note mono"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span> A TEAM EFFORT, ALWAYS. INDIVIDUAL CONTRIBUTIONS & CREDITS INSIDE EACH PROJECT.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="about-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="wrap about-grid">
        <div class="about-intro"><p class="eyebrow mono">02 / THE PERSON BEHIND THE PIXELS</p><h2 id="about-title">A little left brain.<br />A little <span class="serif-word">what if?</span></h2><div class="maker-stamp" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 130 130" fill="none"><path d="M65 5 77 20l19-4 5 19 19 7-6 18 12 15-16 12-1 20-20 1-13 16-15-12-19 6-7-19-19-5 4-20L5 65l15-13-4-19 19-5 7-19 18 6z" fill="#c5ed83" /><path d="m45 55 7-7m26 7 7-7M43 76q21 24 45-3" stroke="#252c21" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg><span class="mono">MADE OF<br />MANY THINGS.</span></div></div>
        <div class="about-copy"><p class="about-lede">I like the moment when an idea becomes something someone can actually <em>do something with.</em></p><p>My background is in industrial design at NUS, with a minor in interactive media. These days, I move between playful interfaces, interactive prototypes, 3D imagery, and exhibition spaces.</p><p>I’m just as interested in where a button belongs as how a whole room comes together. The thread? Making the experience feel right for the person on the other side.</p><p>I use code as a design medium, including AI-assisted development. My recent focus is on experience design, system planning, and directing and refining implementation—with designers, developers, and builders.</p><a class="text-link" href="/resume">The slightly more formal version <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap capabilities"><div><span class="mono">01</span><h3>Think it through.</h3><p>Concepts, user journeys, wireframes, and the questions that make an idea better.</p></div><div><span class="mono">02</span><h3>Make it tangible.</h3><p>Interactive prototypes, interfaces, 3D renders, and spaces you can step into.</p></div><div><span class="mono">03</span><h3>Sweat the details.</h3><p>The feedback, fallbacks, and small refinements that matter beyond the demo.</p></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="contact-section wrap" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div class="contact-top"><p class="eyebrow mono"><span class="live-dot"></span> OPEN TO THE NEXT CHAPTER</p><span class="mono">GOOD PEOPLE. INTERESTING PROBLEMS.</span></div>
      <h2 id="contact-title">Let’s make<br /><span class="contact-indent">something <span class="contact-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></span><br /><span class="serif-word">worth experiencing.</span></h2>
      <div class="contact-bottom"><p>I’m exploring creative technology and interaction<br class="desktop-break" /> prototyping roles with a team I can grow alongside.<br /><span>Think we might make a good connection?</span></p><a class="button button-dark" href="https://github.com/kent12t" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Connect on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer wrap"><a class="footer-brand" href="/">pixelsmith<span class="cobalt">.</span></a><span class="mono">THE PERSONAL PRACTICE OF KENT TIMOTHY LIMANZA</span><a class="back-top mono" href="#main">BACK TO TOP ↑</a></footer>
</Layout>
